WEBVTT

00:00:06.301 --> 00:00:12.301
Choose Site settings in the side menu.

00:00:14.127 --> 00:00:20.127
Click Features and limits.

00:00:20.416 --> 00:00:26.416
Scroll to Guests can watch.

00:00:27.172 --> 00:00:32.958
Untick Guests can watch.

00:00:33.208 --> 00:00:39.208
Click Save changes.

00:00:43.134 --> 00:00:49.134
Tick Guests can watch.

00:00:49.490 --> 00:00:55.490
Click Save changes.

00:00:59.573 --> 00:01:05.573
Scroll to Guest video link minutes.
